kbook:Oil|oil]], divided\n* 6 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], crushed and [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n* 1 green [[Cookbook:Capsicum|capsicum]], cut into 8 pieces\n* 1 red [[Cookbook:Capsicum|capsicum]], cut into 8 pieces\n* 1 big [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], minced\n* 100 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] [[Cookbook:Cream|cream]]\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] fillets, cut into 2 cm pieces\n* 25 g [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Bring the water to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] in a pot. Add the spaghetti and 2 tbsp oil. [[Cookbook:Boiling Pasta|Boil]] for 10 minutes, then drain the spaghetti, reserving some cooking water.\n# Boil the chicken in salted water until the color changes. Drain the chicken.\n# Heat the remaining oil in a non-stick [[Cookbook:Skillet|skillet]]. Add and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] the garlic, capsicum, and onion.\n# Add the drained chicken, cream, black pepper, salt, and parsley. Stir until well-combined.\n# Add the spaghetti, and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] together until well-mixed.\n# Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parsley]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Black-Peppered Chicken Spaghetti","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 pack (800 g) spaghetti noodles","sourceText":"1 pack (800 g) spaghetti noodles","amountText":"1 pack (800 g) spaghetti noodles","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 L water","sourceText":"1 L water","amountTe